{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Reactonix!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your own worlds\u2014or leave nothing but ashes!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A wealth of tools.</strong> Materials, living creatures, forces of nature and much, much more are in your hands. What happens to the world is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>P.S. Most importantly, don't try at home what you do in the game! (=</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426670/extras/7e709d5187ec08bee16cee7b4bcbb531.poster.avif?t=1771598773\" width=800 height=58 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426670/extras/7e709d5187ec08bee16cee7b4bcbb531.webm?t=1771598773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426670/extras/7e709d5187ec08bee16cee7b4bcbb531.mp4?t=1771598773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forces of destruction.</strong> After all, who doesn't need a little fire for fun now and then?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426670/extras/ec36a8a961991a1a6b56218fd6686714.poster.avif?t=1771598773\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426670/extras/ec36a8a961991a1a6b56218fd6686714.webm?t=1771598773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426670/extras/ec36a8a961991a1a6b56218fd6686714.mp4?t=1771598773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life \u2014 from familiar to alien.</strong> From ordinary plants to unimaginable beings and an evolutionary life system that depends on environmental conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426670/extras/36258d0ccdbfb32031e141c6cff884ba.poster.avif?t=1771598773\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426670/extras/36258d0ccdbfb32031e141c6cff884ba.webm?t=1771598773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426670/extras/36258d0ccdbfb32031e141c6cff884ba.mp4?t=1771598773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physical processes.</strong> Detailed simulation of natural phenomena, down to the ability to control individual cells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426670/extras/5933f5d215bde18e07e53d22d7c847e7.poster.avif?t=1771598773\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426670/extras/5933f5d215bde18e07e53d22d7c847e7.webm?t=1771598773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426670/extras/5933f5d215bde18e07e53d22d7c847e7.mp4?t=1771598773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't be alone!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op.</strong> Invite friends into your world or join theirs to create and destroy together! Or maybe, not entirely together... (=</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426670/extras/a8556e99eb345871533a46234e68c707.poster.avif?t=1771598773\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426670/extras/a8556e99eb345871533a46234e68c707.webm?t=1771598773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426670/extras/a8556e99eb345871533a46234e68c707.mp4?t=1771598773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Workshop.</strong> Share your worlds and recorded statistics with the community!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mod support.</strong> The game includes tools for integrating mods into many parts. Create new tools, materials, processes\u2014or something bigger\u2014if you want!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More than just sight!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple view modes.</strong> Is it boring to look at the world with only your eyes? Observe temperature, creatures and other processes separately!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426670/extras/cad43cd146213705b517c9ffe503d558.poster.avif?t=1771598773\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426670/extras/cad43cd146213705b517c9ffe503d558.webm?t=1771598773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426670/extras/cad43cd146213705b517c9ffe503d558.mp4?t=1771598773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Statistics.</strong> Ever wanted to feel like a scientist? Now you can rely not only on your eyes but also on numbers and charts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >